<title>USA: Hudson names controller Regenstein CFO.</title>
<headline>Hudson names controller Regenstein CFO.</headline>
<dateline>GREAT NECK, N.Y. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hudson General Corp Friday named its controller Barry Regenstein chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Regenstein replaces president Michael Rubin, who will give up his role as chief financial officer. The company named Rubin president in 1996, but he continued as chief financial officer until now.</p>
